<title>JAPAN: Nippon Kasei - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Kasei - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 15.16		vs	   15.50</p>
<p> Operating	   51    million    vs	  362    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 227    million    vs	  prft 5 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 213    million    vs	  prft 2 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 2.70 yen	  vs     prft 0.02 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     79 million	  vs	  79 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Kasei Chemical Co Ltd is a chemical fertiliser manufacturer affiliated with Mitsubishi Chemical Corp.</p>
</text>
